Modifications made to the original work:

  - Exported the PyTorch checkpoint (model.pt) to ONNX using the pipeline at
    https://github.com/Wasser1462/FunASR-nano-onnx
    (encoder_adaptor, embedding, and Qwen3-0.6B LLM graphs).
  - Applied ONNX Runtime dynamic INT8 quantization to the exported graphs.
  - Packaged the resulting files for sherpa-onnx (OfflineRecognizer.from_funasr_nano).
  - The tokenizer directory is copied unchanged from the base checkpoint.

No fine-tuning or weight modification was performed other than quantization.

